    "summary": "Whenever Aun’shi is **selected to fight**, pick one of these to apply as those attacks resolve:\n\n- **Direct Grace**: Fidelity gets **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)**\n- **Forceful Strike**: Fidelity gets **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)**\n- **Whirling Stance**: Fidelity gets **[[SUSTAINED HITS 2]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** in place of **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**",
